'''Michael's Crib''' is a [[Location]] found on the {{Zone|Spider's Den}}. It is home to {{NPCSprite|Michael}} and {{NPCSprite|Ike}}, who explain [[Mob Types]].

{{ZoneText
|Learn about &cMob Types &ffrom &6Michael&f!
|Collect &cMob Types &ffor &6Ike&f to earn &6Rewards&f!
}}

== Purpose ==
{{NPCSprite|Michael}} is the primary [[NPC]] in '''Michael's Crib'''. He explains how [[Mob Types]] work, and then informs the player to speak to {{NPCSprite|Ike}} to see their progress on which types of [[Mobs]] they have killed. Killing a new type for the first time grants one time rewards.

